{"availability":"available","full":"pocha/terminal-codelearn","name":"terminal-codelearn","description":"Super fast multi user pseudo bash Terminal in Node.js & SockJS","category":"Education","language":"JavaScript","stars":79,"forks":27,"created":"2013-02-22T21:00:27Z","updated":"2020-11-09T19:04:33Z","branch":"master","homepage":"http://pocha.github.io/terminal-codelearn","topics":[],"demo":"http://pocha.github.io/terminal-codelearn","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.528Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.528Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.528Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.528Z","stars":79,"forks":27}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The purpose of this app is NOT to emulate a true Terminal. It is designed to let website owners give a web based Pseudo Terminal to their users who can run linux commands.","Update - Autocomplete works the native way now. Command navigation is handled on the javascript side so it does NOT persist across page load. Other complicated bash shortcuts wont work.","Check the live demo. The app is currently deployed in production in Codelearn Playground."],"features":["No typing lag Unlike any other web Terminal emulation on the web (or a remote SSH client), which reports every keypress to the backend & eventually slowing down the typing, this app only sends data when 'enter' key is…","Super fast execution & data transfer The app uses Node.js backend & SockJS for communication. You probably cant get anything else doing things faster than what the two beasts are doing. Scroll down to check latency…","Works for users behind proxy One of the most popular project Gateone which solved the problem, does not work behind proxy. Since this project has SockJS, the communication protocol degrades to a non-websocket protocol…","Bash shortcuts do not work Bash shortcuts like tab autocomplete, previous/next command navigation using up/down arrow key etc does not work. The data is sent to the server only on 'enter' press & the response is…","Can not run Vim/Emacs Again since every keypress does not get reported, things simply hung while running Vim or Emacs."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pocha/terminal-codelearn/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"0c7b773f4b67e5341cd925f20a6d74e051374a1c4480ff3025eaccf4aaac4920","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.652Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.652Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The purpose of this app is NOT to emulate a true Terminal. It is designed to let website owners give a web based Pseudo Terminal to their users who can run linux commands.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pocha/terminal-codelearn/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0c7b773f4b67e5341cd925f20a6d74e051374a1c4480ff3025eaccf4aaac4920","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pocha/terminal-codelearn/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.652Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2020-11-09T19:04:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pocha/terminal-codelearn/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.653Z","hash":"0c7b773f4b67e5341cd925f20a6d74e051374a1c4480ff3025eaccf4aaac4920","originalBytes":7044,"storedBytes":7044,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["server","client","install","run","server.","terminal","user","data","graph","start","time","username","app","application","benchmarking","command","file.","mocha","npm","side","signature","single","which","bash","benchmark","clients","cpu","does","each","forever","multiple","particular","users","web","average","behind","below","change","client.html","connected","delay","down","generate","key","lib","linux","logs","messages","modules","mongodb","now","number","output","public","scripts","sends","shortcuts","shows","taken","tests","typing","while","autocomplete","backend","because","check","checkout","commands","config.js","configuratio